    "partialUniqueRules": [
      "`season_extension`要求one match/zero overlap、Candidate与Subject的`structure_kind/content_profile`逐字节相等及完整target CAS。Continuity无匹配、多匹配或Episode overlap仍是`new_subject`，不得成为rejection。同一Candidate/Package digest只允许一个accepted Decision的partial unique index"
    ],
