    "immutability": {
      "immutable": true,
      "rules": [
        "六项source/profile provenance逐项复制Delivery Snapshot并成为Libra-owned immutable事实，不能在Routing时回读Procurement。无法取得完整Snapshot属于Delivery integrity/system failure，不伪造Rejected Decision。`accepted_resolution`要求continuity/match/overlap、accepted result/target、committed Subject digest及accepted payload完整非NULL，全部rejection列为NULL",
        "immutable，不接受调用者指定既有Subject或伪造head值"
      ]
    },
    "deletion": {
      "foreignKeyPolicy": "ON DELETE RESTRICT",
      "rules": []
    },
    "semanticRules": [
      "`decision_revision=1`且`UNIQUE(offer_id)`",
      "`intake_decision_id=SHA-256(JCS({schema:\"libra.intake-decision-id@1\",offerId}))`",
      "common Offer/Package/Acceptance Basis/Snapshot及Related disposition scope逐项匹配正式Delivery",
      "六项source/profile provenance逐项复制Delivery Snapshot并成为Libra-owned immutable事实，不能在Routing时回读Procurement。无法取得完整Snapshot属于Delivery integrity/system failure，不伪造Rejected Decision。`accepted_resolution`要求continuity/match/overlap、accepted result/target、committed Subject digest及accepted payload完整非NULL，全部rejection列为NULL",
      "其`decision_digest`逐字节等于`SubjectContinuityResolutionDecision@1.decisionDigest`。`rejected_acceptance`要求全部continuity/head/match/target/accepted列为NULL，rejection列完整非NULL",
      "其`decision_digest`逐字节等于`IntakeRejectionDecision@1.decisionDigest`。`new_subject`要求target是Libra分配的新ID",
      "`season_extension`要求one match/zero overlap、Candidate与Subject的`structure_kind/content_profile`逐字节相等及完整target CAS。Continuity无匹配、多匹配或Episode overlap仍是`new_subject`，不得成为rejection。同一Candidate/Package digest只允许一个accepted Decision的partial unique index",
      "不同Acceptance Basis的新Offer可以各自保留Rejected Decision，但任何后续Accepted仍受该唯一约束",
      "immutable，不接受调用者指定既有Subject或伪造head值"
    ],
    "rawContract": {
      "columns": "`intake_decision_id PK, decision_revision, decision_kind(accepted_resolution|rejected_acceptance), offer_id, candidate_package_id, package_revision, package_digest, acceptance_basis_digest, candidate_delivery_snapshot_digest, related_disposition_scope_digest, source_field_id, source_field_access_revision, source_field_context_digest, candidate_structure_kind, candidate_content_profile, candidate_identity_claim_digest, expected_continuity_head_revision NULL, expected_continuity_head_digest NULL, committed_continuity_head_revision NULL, candidate_continuity_set_digest NULL, candidate_episode_scope_digest NULL, match_cardinality NULL|none|one|multiple, matched_subject_set_digest NULL, episode_overlap_digest NULL, accepted_result NULL|new_subject|season_extension, target_subject_id NULL, expected_target_status NULL, expected_target_intake_revision NULL, expected_target_continuity_set_digest NULL, expected_target_episode_scope_digest NULL, committed_target_intake_revision NULL, committed_subject_continuity_set_digest NULL, committed_subject_episode_scope_digest NULL, accepted_payload_digest NULL, rejection_schema_ref NULL, rejection_id NULL, primary_rejection_code NULL, rejection_reason_set_digest NULL, rejection_digest NULL, decision_digest, decided_at_ms`",
      "constraints": "`decision_revision=1`且`UNIQUE(offer_id)`；`intake_decision_id=SHA-256(JCS({schema:\"libra.intake-decision-id@1\",offerId}))`；common Offer/Package/Acceptance Basis/Snapshot及Related disposition scope逐项匹配正式Delivery；六项source/profile provenance逐项复制Delivery Snapshot并成为Libra-owned immutable事实，不能在Routing时回读Procurement。无法取得完整Snapshot属于Delivery integrity/system failure，不伪造Rejected Decision。`accepted_resolution`要求continuity/match/overlap、accepted result/target、committed Subject digest及accepted payload完整非NULL，全部rejection列为NULL；其`decision_digest`逐字节等于`SubjectContinuityResolutionDecision@1.decisionDigest`。`rejected_acceptance`要求全部continuity/head/match/target/accepted列为NULL，rejection列完整非NULL；其`decision_digest`逐字节等于`IntakeRejectionDecision@1.decisionDigest`。`new_subject`要求target是Libra分配的新ID；`season_extension`要求one match/zero overlap、Candidate与Subject的`structure_kind/content_profile`逐字节相等及完整target CAS。Continuity无匹配、多匹配或Episode overlap仍是`new_subject`，不得成为rejection。同一Candidate/Package digest只允许一个accepted Decision的partial unique index；不同Acceptance Basis的新Offer可以各自保留Rejected Decision，但任何后续Accepted仍受该唯一约束；immutable，不接受调用者指定既有Subject或伪造head值"
    },
